\"has_related_synonym\")\n3713: \n3714: # Annotation Property: oboInOwl:hasSynonymType (has_synonym_type)\n3715: \n3716: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:hasSynonymType \"has_synonym_type\")\n3717: \n3718: # Annotation Property: oboInOwl:inSubset (in_subset)\n3719: \n3720: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:inSubset \"in_subset\")\n3721: \n3722: # Annotation Property: rdfs:seeAlso (see also)\n3723: \n3724: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdfs:seeAlso \"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso\")\n3725: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:shorthand rdfs:seeAlso \"seeAlso\")\n3726: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label rdfs:seeAlso \"see also\")\n3727: \n\n(Showing lines 3678-3727 of 35841. Use offset=3728 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"\nSubAnnotationPropertyOf(core:human_reference_atlas oboInOwl:SubsetProperty)\n\n# Annotation Property: ubprop:_upper_level (ubprop:_upper_level)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment ubprop:_upper_level \"abstract upper-level terms not directly useful for analysis\")\nSubAnnotationPropertyOf(ubprop:_upper_level oboInOwl:SubsetProperty)\n\n# Annotation Property: oboInOwl:SubsetProperty (subset_property)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:SubsetProperty \"subset_property\")\n\n# Annotation Property: oboInOwl:consider (consider)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:consider \"consider\")\n\n# Annotation Property: oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym (has_broad_synonym)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym \"has_broad_synonym\")\n","truncated":true,"loaded":[]},"title":"src/ontology/cl-edit.owl","time":{"start":1778980022650,"end":1778980022774}},"id":"prt_e3378e9740010zw3pQ0NYsc4VG","sessionID":"ses_1cc878660ffeScT320AS3yfuxY","messageID":"msg_e3378c946001vd6R1muRxQUgVC"}}
